{"contract":"bw-jmdict-shard/3","entries":[{"accent":1,"common":true,"examples":[{"en":"Don't throw away cans on the street.","ja":"道に缶をすてるな。","ref":"280383_123614","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"I put the used syringes in a can for safe disposal.","ja":"私は使い古した注射器を安全に捨てるために缶の中に入れました。","ref":"257929_156605","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"I have nothing to open the can with.","ja":"その缶を開ける物がないんだ。","ref":"254108_160413","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"The can is empty.","ja":"缶は空っぽだ。","ref":"20950_183826","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"Could I get one more beer, please?","ja":"ビールをもう１缶いただけますか。","ref":"34842_197656","source":"tanaka"}],"forms":["缶","罐","鑵"],"glosses":["can","tin","canned food"],"id":"1214540","lemma":"缶","pos":["n","ctr"],"readingKata":"カン","readings":["かん","カン"]},{"common":false,"forms":["缶ジュース"],"glosses":["canned juice","canned soft drink","can of juice","can of soft drink"],"id":"1214550","lemma":"缶ジュース","pos":["n"],"readings":["かんジュース"]},{"accent":3,"common":true,"etymology":["源自缶(かん) (kan，“罐頭”) + 詰(つ)め (tsume，動詞詰(つ)める (tsumeru，“填滿，裝滿”) 的連(れん)用(よう)形(けい) (ren'yōkei)。)。tsume 因連濁變為 zume。"],"examples":[{"ja":"家に缶詰にする。","source":"wty","zh":"关在家里。"},{"en":"He gave me a select brand of canned goods.","ja":"彼は私に缶詰の極上品を贈ってくれた。","ref":"297586_106100","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"He cut his finger in opening a can.","ja":"彼は缶詰をあけているうちに指を切った。","ref":"289602_114070","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"There was no fresh meat in the market today, so you'll have to content yourselves with something out of a tin.","ja":"今日は市場に肉がなかったから、缶詰で我慢しなければならない。","ref":"242863_171612","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"Canned food doesn't interest her.","ja":"缶詰の食料は彼女のお気に召さない。","ref":"20949_183825","source":"tanaka"}],"forms":["缶詰","缶詰め","罐詰め","罐詰"],"glosses":["canned food","tinned food","confining someone (e.g. so they can concentrate on work)","being stuck in a confined space"],"id":"1214560","lemma":"缶詰","pos":["n","adj-no"],"readingKata":"カンヅメ","readings":["かんづめ","カンヅメ","カンズメ"],"sourceUrls":["https://zh.wiktionar